WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.143
Find the operation connecting consecutive terms. Use the same step to extend the

00:00:05.143 --> 00:00:06.664
sequence and justify it.

00:00:07.533 --> 00:00:15.937
Continue: 7, 17, 27, ... What is term 7? The answer is 67. Term 7 is 7 plus 6 times

00:00:15.937 --> 00:00:17.197
10 equals 67.

00:00:18.033 --> 00:00:23.586
The values 6, 9, 12 describe a pattern at a school fair. What is the value at step 6

00:00:23.586 --> 00:00:26.801
(counting the first as step 1)? Pause the video and think.

00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:33.749
The values 6, 9, 12 describe a pattern at a school fair. What is the value at step 6

00:00:33.749 --> 00:00:39.881
(counting the first as step 1)? The answer is 21. Term 6 is 6 plus 5 times 3 equals

00:00:39.881 --> 00:00:40.203
21.
